<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's May wholesale prices +0.4 pct, -3.0 yr/y.</title>
<headline>Morocco's May wholesale prices +0.4 pct, -3.0 yr/y.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Statistics Directorate on Thursday issued the following economic indicators:</p>
<p>    MOROCCO'S WHOLESALE PRICES:	 May 97</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)	     +0.4</p>
<p>    Year/year average change	     -3.0</p>
<p>(Basis= 1977)</p>
<p>The monthly variation was attributed to the agriculture index rise, the directorate said.</p>
<p>-- Newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
